# Hugging Face token, for downloading GATED model weights.
#
# Copy to deploy/hf.env and fill in. That file is gitignored.
#
# Not needed for the models this stack runs today — google/gemma-4-E4B-it,
# nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2 and hexgrad/Kokoro-82M are all ungated, and were
# verified so with:
#   curl -s https://huggingface.co/api/models/<id> | grep '"gated"'
#
# up-voice-gh200.sh sources this file if it exists, so the start scripts pass
# the token through to the containers without it being in your shell history.
HF_TOKEN=
